<title>USA: Watsco Inc says acquires Air Systems.</title>
<headline>Watsco Inc says acquires Air Systems.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watsco Inc said it completed the acquisition of Air Systems Distributors Inc, a privately-held wholesale distributor of residential and commericial air conditioning equipment and related products.</p>
<p>The company said the Miami-based acquisition has over 800 contractors throughout Florida and expects revenues in the current year to be about $9 million.</p>
<p>Air Systems gives Watsco increased presence Florida's commercial equipment market, it said.</p>
</text>
